---
<section aria-labelledby="closing-cta-heading" class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-[#F9F9F9]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-dark-700 bg-dark-900 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-xl flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-brand-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>Zero Scope Creep · North America (CST)</span>
        </div>
        <h2 id="closing-cta-heading" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
          Ready to eliminate flaky CI and WCAG risk?
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Benchmark your release pipeline in 60 seconds or grab a direct 15-minute architecture fit call. No sales decks, no agency handoffs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
        <a
          href="#qa-diagnostic"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 rounded-md text-sm font-bold text-dark-900 bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors shadow-sm focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-400 whitespace-nowrap"
        >
          Run 60-Sec Diagnostic
        </a>
        <a
          href="#book-call"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 rounded-md text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 border border-dark-600 bg-dark-800 hover:bg-dark-700 hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-400 whitespace-nowrap"
        >
          Book 15-Min Fit Call
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
